menu "SomnoPal"

    config SOMNOPAL_DEV_UNPROTECTED
        bool "Allow unprotected NVS in development builds"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, SomnoPal falls back to plain (unencrypted) NVS
            when the eFuse HMAC key for NVS encryption is not provisioned,
            and displays "DEVELOPMENT — STORAGE UNPROTECTED" at runtime.
            Must be OFF for production: a missing key then fails closed
            with SECURITY_NOT_PROVISIONED (spec §4.2).

endmenu
